/* PORTHOT (2026-10-13): the named hot functions move OUT of .portcode (cart) and into
 * .ramtext (SDRAM, boot-copied by mars_start.s). Measured on the line: the master spends
 * 267,550 cyc/vint cart-resident at CPI 3.06, and the hot game functions run at CPI 9-13.5
 * because .portcode is cart. This is the 68K era's WRAMCODE lesson on the SH-2.
 * .portcode selects only `.text .text.* .rodata .rodata.*` from portfull objects, so a
 * function placed in `.ramtext` is not matched by it and needs no new output section. */
#ifdef PORT_HOT
#define PORTHOT __attribute__((section(".ramtext")))
#else
#define PORTHOT
#endif
